1
00:00:00,415 --> 00:00:01,795
Shh. Act normal.

2
00:00:01,958 --> 00:00:03,998
(Leonard:)Sheldon!

3
00:00:05,128 --> 00:00:09,008
- How was the comic-book store?
- Fine. The new issue of Flash is out.

4
00:00:09,174 --> 00:00:10,554
(Leonard:)Great, great.

5
00:00:10,717 --> 00:00:13,347
(Leonard:)Did you walk the whole way?
It's a little chilly.

6
00:00:13,511 --> 00:00:16,601
- Koothrappali picked me up.
- Isn't that terrific?

7
00:00:16,765 --> 00:00:18,395
(Leonard:)He is such a good friend.

8
00:00:18,558 --> 00:00:21,098
(Leonard:)You know what the best thing
about friends is?

9
00:00:21,269 --> 00:00:24,689
(Sheldon:)They don't talk incessantly
for no particular reason?

10
00:00:24,856 --> 00:00:28,026
(Leonard:)No, no, friends forgive the little things.

11
00:00:28,193 --> 00:00:30,943
- I'm gonna go home and wash my hair.
- Don't you dare, missy.

12
00:00:33,406 --> 00:00:36,826
(Sheldon:)Hello, fastest man alive.

13
00:00:36,993 --> 00:00:40,413
Wanna see me
read your entire comic book?

14
00:00:40,580 --> 00:01:01,020
Wanna see it again?

